      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The Court : In my opinion, orders in this writ application can only be passed if it is properly heard out on exchange of affidavits.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 586,
      "end": 718,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "A lot of materials are required to be gone into by the Court, including the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, The Food Safety and Standards [Food Products Standards and Food Additives] Regulations, 2011, the import documents of the writ petitioner, previous import records etc.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 719,
      "end": 999,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 795,
          "end": 830
        },
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and Standards [Food Products Standards and Food Additives] Regulations, 2011",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 836,
          "end": 924
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "A substantial question is involved as to whether Sugar Boiled Confectionery containing seaweed as an ingredient can be permitted to be imported into India.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1000,
      "end": 1155,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "India",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1149,
          "end": 1154
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22662219405174255
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The writ petition is admitted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1156,
      "end": 1187,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.255990207195282
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Let affidavit in opposition be filed by the third respondent by 14th August, 2014.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1189,
      "end": 1271,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "14th August, 2014",
          "label": "DATE",
